  "body": "Fixes https://github.com/w3c/webcomponents/issues/563, and an analogous\nissue when the constructor uses return-override, by ensuring that all\nexceptions go through the same path, which both sets the custom element\nstate to \"failed\", and clears the custom element reaction queue.\n\n/cc @davaajav-shino @kojiishi @rniwa @dominiccooney, although I don't think this is blocked on your review as it's a pretty straightforward implementation of the consensus from https://github.com/w3c/webcomponents/issues/563.\n",
